        "text": "RESPONSE\n<<<\nThe meeting is at six.\n>>>\n\nTARGET\n<<<\nthe meeting time\n>>>\n\nTYPE\n<<<\nstring\n>>>\n\nMODE\n<<<\nlenient\n>>>"
